DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
3794::$$$message_0028_0000_0000$$$::I'll go talk to Sakura about lunch.[lr]::
3795::$$$message_0028_0000_0001$$$::We have a big family to feed. It's a lot easier when we both work at it together.::
3796::$$$message_0028_0001_0000$$$::Sakura normally lives at the Matou residence, but she stays at my house on weekends and long holidays.[lr]::
3797::$$$message_0028_0001_0001$$$::Rider and Saber prefer the Japanese-style rooms in the main building, while Sakura and Tohsaka prefer the Western-style rooms in the guesthouse.[lr]::
3798::$$$message_0028_0001_0002$$$::On top of that, Fuji-nee and Illya show up sometimes for meals, so the population of the Emiya household has exploded.::
3799::$$$message_0028_0002_0000$$$::"Sakura, you there?"[lr]::
3800::$$$message_0028_0002_0001$$$::"Huh? Ah, Senpai!?[lr]::
3801::$$$message_0028_0002_0002$$$::Hold on, no, fine, yes!"::
3802::$$$message_0028_0003_0000$$$::[se storage=se422.wav]...I have no idea if it's okay to go in or not.[lr]::
3803::$$$message_0028_0003_0001$$$::I think the "fine" gave me permission[se storage=se288.wav] to enter, or maybe she was telling me she's fine for now and I should come back later[se storage=se406.wav]...[se storage=se217.wav][lr]::
3804::$$$message_0028_0003_0002$$$::I did suddenly intrude on her, so maybe I should leave and come back after all.::
3805::$$$message_0028_0004_0000$$$::"Hey, it can wait if you're busy."[lr]::
3806::$$$message_0028_0004_0001$$$::"I'm not busy! Please come in!"[lr]::
3807::$$$message_0028_0004_0002$$$::"...All right, I will then."::
3808::$$$message_0028_0005_0000$$$::"S-sorry to keep you waiting![lr]::
3809::$$$message_0028_0005_0001$$$::Um, what did you need, Senpai?"::
3810::$$$message_0028_0006_0000$$$::"I wanted to talk to you about lunch.[lr]::
3811::$$$message_0028_0006_0001$$$::It's a little early, but I thought I could hang out with you for a little while first."[lr]::
3812::$$$message_0028_0006_0002$$$::"Ah...[wait canskip=false time=400][chgfg storage=桜私服10e(中) time=200 textoff=0][cacheimage storage=桜私服10b頬(中)][wvl canskip=false time=200][chgfg time=200 storage=桜私服10b頬(中) textoff=0] I-I appreciate that."[lr]::
3813::$$$message_0028_0006_0003$$$::"So... Wait, I haven't done anything for you to thank me yet."::
3814::$$$message_0028_0007_0000$$$::I feel bashful now, too.[lr]::
3815::$$$message_0028_0007_0001$$$::...How pathetic. I should be used to being around her, but I start to feel shy whenever we're alone together.::
3816::$$$message_0028_0008_0000$$$::"...Right. Then please make yourself at home."[lr]::
3817::$$$message_0028_0008_0001$$$::"...Thanks. I feel like I'm imposing, though."::
3818::$$$message_0028_0009_0000$$$::"Ahaha, not at all. I actually slept in.[lr]::
3819::$$$message_0028_0009_0001$$$::But now I'm awake, thanks to you. I managed not to be lazy today![lr]::
3820::$$$message_0028_0009_0002$$$::...Um, that's what I wanted to thank you for...is that okay?"[lr]::
3821::$$$message_0028_0009_0003$$$::"Oh, that's what you mean. Then, don't mind if I do..."::
3822::$$$message_0028_0010_0000$$$::I have no reason to refuse now.[lr]::
3823::$$$message_0028_0010_0001$$$::I enter and sit down in Sakura's bedroom. There's a faint, sweet aroma in the air.[lr]::
3824::$$$message_0028_0010_0002$$$::Huh...is that perfume or air freshener?::
3825::$$$message_0028_0011_0000$$$::"Ah... Is it too strong?"[lr]::
3826::$$$message_0028_0011_0001$$$::"Huh? I don't think the AC or heater are on..."::
3827::$$$message_0028_0012_0000$$$::"No, it seems like you noticed the scent... [cacheimage storage=桜私服02e頬(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜私服02e頬(中) time=300 textoff=0]I used a little bit of fragrance."::
3828::$$$message_0028_0013_0000$$$::So it was perfume.[lr]::
3829::$$$message_0028_0013_0001$$$::...I don't know what brand it is, but it smells good. So, Sakura uses it too.::
3830::$$$message_0028_0014_0000$$$::"Um, I thought it would be good to put some on."[lr]::
3831::$$$message_0028_0014_0001$$$::"Well... I think it suits you."[lr]::
3832::$$$message_0028_0014_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服10b頬(中) textoff=0]The person who uses perfume most often in our household is...[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服02b頬(中) textoff=0]Tohsaka, I think. She's pretty conscious about using different scents for different situations.::
3833::$$$message_0028_0015_0000$$$::"Tohsaka uses perfume to hide the strange scent of the medicine she uses, but yours is different."[lr]::
3834::$$$message_0028_0015_0001$$$::"I just learned by watching others.[lr]::
3835::$$$message_0028_0015_0002$$$::My sister uses a lot of different products. It isn't easy."[lr]::
3836::$$$message_0028_0015_0003$$$::Huh... Have they been giving each other makeup lessons?[lr]::
3837::$$$message_0028_0015_0004$$$::What a harmonious sibling relationship.::
3838::$$$message_0028_0016_0000$$$::"I see. I don't think it would be a good fit for me. It sounds really elegant, the way you two talk about it, though."[lr]::
3839::$$$message_0028_0016_0001$$$::"Really? I think it's wonderful when men use cologne effectively."[lr]::
3840::$$$message_0028_0016_0002$$$::"Oof... If I do, I feel like Saber or Mitsuzuri would get mad and call me weak for using perfume."::
3841::$$$message_0028_0017_0000$$$::"Mitsuzuri-senpai probably would be upset. She practically worships you.[lr]::
3842::$$$message_0028_0017_0001$$$::But I think cologne would suit you.[lr]::
3843::$$$message_0028_0017_0002$$$::...I'd like to buy some for Rider's personal use, but she doesn't seem interested..."::
3844::$$$message_0028_0018_0000$$$::"You've got a lot to worry about. But..."[lr]::
3845::$$$message_0028_0018_0001$$$::As I sit in Sakura's room, I remember.[lr]::
3846::$$$message_0028_0018_0002$$$::All the members of our household who came up as we were talking.::
3847::$$$message_0028_0019_0000$$$::"...A lot of people live in this house now."[lr]::
3848::$$$message_0028_0019_0001$$$::"That's true. I thought it was lively when I began staying over, but I never thought we'd have so many people here."::
3849::$$$message_0028_0020_0000$$$::Sakura laughs.[lr]::
3850::$$$message_0028_0020_0001$$$::...Right, only she and Fuji-nee know what this house used to be like.[lr]::
3851::$$$message_0028_0020_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服07c(中) textoff=0]It's changed a lot in a short time. I'm not sure whether to be impressed or shocked.::
3852::$$$message_0028_0021_0000$$$::"It used to feel so empty whenever anyone left the house. This part of it, too."[lr]::
3853::$$$message_0028_0021_0001$$$::She nods.[lr]::
3854::$$$message_0028_0021_0002$$$::Fuji-nee comes and goes, but doesn't live here. Sakura came over to help with breakfast and dinner, but she didn't used to stay over during the day.[lr]::
3855::$$$message_0028_0021_0003$$$::For a long time, I was the only person who lived here.[lr]::
3856::$$$message_0028_0021_0004$$$::It didn't make me feel lonely, but now that I look back, that was rather...::
3857::$$$message_0028_0022_0000$$$::"Yeah, I remember being surprised that you lived in this huge estate all by yourself."[lr]::
3858::$$$message_0028_0022_0001$$$::...It was over two years ago.[lr]::
3859::$$$message_0028_0022_0002$$$::Back then, Sakura was a serious girl who never smiled. She showed up one day with a brooding look and said she wanted to start coming here.::
3860::$$$message_0028_0023_0000$$$::"...Really? Your house is pretty big, too."[lr]::
3861::$$$message_0028_0023_0001$$$::"No, our homes are spacious in different ways.[lr]::
3862::$$$message_0028_0023_0002$$$::The Matou house has always been uninviting. But these rooms feel like they want to be filled."::
3863::$$$message_0028_0024_0000$$$::"Even Rider seems happier and more at ease here. I'm sure Saber feels the same way."::
3864::$$$message_0028_0025_0000$$$::"Really...huh.[lr]::
3865::$$$message_0028_0025_0001$$$::At the time, I felt like this place turned into a boardinghouse, and also that we had more hands to help with the housework."[lr]::
3866::$$$message_0028_0025_0002$$$::"It really was hard cleaning the entire house."::
3867::$$$message_0028_0026_0000$$$::Sakura smiles, fondly remembering the past.[lr]::
3868::$$$message_0028_0026_0001$$$::...There are still a lot of unused rooms, but before most of them were used for storage.[lr]::
3869::$$$message_0028_0026_0002$$$::Buildings quickly fall into ruin when people don't live in them.[lr]::
3870::$$$message_0028_0026_0003$$$::It was quite an undertaking to clean the entire compound.::
3871::$$$message_0028_0027_0000$$$::"...Yeah. I think our next end-of-year cleaning will go a lot smoother."[lr]::
3872::$$$message_0028_0027_0001$$$::"Rider's good at cleaning, you know.[lr]::
3873::$$$message_0028_0027_0002$$$::So we can rest easy!"[lr]::
3874::$$$message_0028_0027_0003$$$::Sakura looks as proud as if she were talking about herself.[lr]::
3875::$$$message_0028_0027_0004$$$::Rider does like keeping things tidy, but her bigger asset would be her strength, I guess.::
3876::$$$message_0028_0028_0000$$$::"But..."[lr]::
3877::$$$message_0028_0028_0001$$$::"Yes?"[lr]::
3878::$$$message_0028_0028_0002$$$::"Don't you get nostalgic for when things used to be quieter?"::
3879::$$$message_0028_0029_0000$$$::The question slips out.[lr]::
3880::$$$message_0028_0029_0001$$$::No reason for it; it's just what I'm wondering in the moment.::
3881::$$$message_0028_0030_0000$$$::"...I do think it's a shame that I can't be alone with you anymore."[lr]::
3882::$$$message_0028_0030_0001$$$::"..."::
3883::$$$message_0028_0031_0000$$$::She's right.[lr]::
3884::$$$message_0028_0031_0001$$$::We used to be the only ones in the house before Fuji-nee came over for breakfast, and she often used to wake me in the shed.[lr]::
3885::$$$message_0028_0031_0002$$$::Is she saying that she wishes she could be alone with me now?::
3886::$$$message_0028_0032_0000$$$::"...O-oh."[lr]::
3887::$$$message_0028_0032_0001$$$::The realization takes me by surprise.[lr]::
3888::$$$message_0028_0032_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
3889::$$$message_0028_0032_0003$$$::I used to see her as a little sister, but she's matured so much that I have mixed feelings about staying as a brother figure...::
3890::$$$message_0028_0033_0000$$$::"...Mrgh."[lr]::
3891::$$$message_0028_0033_0001$$$::In an attempt to avoid eye contact, my eyes wander over to the bed.::
3892::$$$message_0028_0034_0000$$$::"B-but you know, it's good that the house is so lively! We get to cook a lot, too."[lr]::
3893::$$$message_0028_0034_0001$$$::"Y-[wvl][shock vmax=15 time=300 count=-3]yeah!"::
3894::$$$message_0028_0035_0000$$$::"It's a bit of a hassle having to take turns in the bath, and there's a lot of laundry to do, but I'm totally fine with it!"[lr]::
3895::$$$message_0028_0035_0001$$$::"Yeah, let's do our best to make it work. [wvl][shock vmax=15 time=300 count=-3]Together!"::
3896::$$$message_0028_0036_0000$$$::We both rush to agree with each other.[lr]::
3897::$$$message_0028_0036_0001$$$::I wonder if Sakura's trying as hard to hide her pounding heart as I am.::
3898::$$$message_0028_0037_0000$$$::"...Um,[lr]::
3899::$$$message_0028_0037_0001$$$::do you miss how quiet it used to be, Senpai?"[lr]::
3900::$$$message_0028_0037_0002$$$::"Ah... [wvl canskip=0 time=600]No, not necessarily.[lr]::
3901::$$$message_0028_0037_0003$$$::The past is the past, and the present is the present. Each have their pros and cons."[lr]::
3902::$$$message_0028_0037_0004$$$::No, that isn't true.[lr]::
3903::$$$message_0028_0037_0005$$$::I don't have a single bad thing to say about life right now.::
3904::$$$message_0028_0038_0000$$$::"Yeah... I think things could stand to be a little more exciting, actually."[lr]::
3905::$$$message_0028_0038_0001$$$::"Haha. I wonder who's going to move in next..."[lr]::
3906::$$$message_0028_0038_0002$$$::Issei? It's hard to imagine him coming all the way down from the mountain.[lr]::
3907::$$$message_0028_0038_0003$$$::...You never know. Even Tohsaka's been coming over recently.::
3908::$$$message_0028_0039_0000$$$::"Do you think Illya or Ms. Fujimura would move in?"[lr]::
3909::$$$message_0028_0039_0001$$$::"Urgh... Illya would have a hard time."[lr]::
3910::$$$message_0028_0039_0002$$$::Her maids would have to come with her, so we'd have to suddenly accommodate three more people. We're almost at capacity as it is.::
3911::$$$message_0028_0040_0000$$$::Then, I lightly slap my thigh in realization.[lr]::
3912::$$$message_0028_0040_0001$$$::"Either way, Sakura..."[lr]::
3913::$$$message_0028_0040_0002$$$::"Yes?"::
3914::$$$message_0028_0041_0000$$$::"Our kitchen team has a big responsibility no matter how many people live here. Let's give it our all."[lr]::
3915::$$$message_0028_0041_0001$$$::The number of cooks won't increase, even if the residents do.[lr]::
3916::$$$message_0028_0041_0002$$$::We actually used to have too many cooks compared to residents.::
3917::$$$message_0028_0042_0000$$$::"Yeah, it's a good chance to show off our skills."[lr]::
3918::$$$message_0028_0042_0001$$$::"They say appetites grow in the fall."::
3919::$$$message_0028_0043_0000$$$::"...Yeah.[lr]::
3920::$$$message_0028_0043_0001$$$::Please teach me even more, Senpai."[lr]::
3921::$$$message_0028_0043_0002$$$::I'm starting to get a little hungry after this chat.[lr]::
3922::$$$message_0028_0043_0003$$$::Maybe it's about time.::
3923::$$$message_0028_0044_0000$$$::"Sakura, what should we do for lunch?"[lr]::
3924::$$$message_0028_0044_0001$$$::"Let's think about it in the kitchen.[lr]::
3925::$$$message_0028_0044_0002$$$::I'm sure we can make anything together."[lr]::
3926::$$$message_0028_0044_0003$$$::"O-oh, sure.[lr]::
3927::$$$message_0028_0044_0004$$$::I'll check who else will be having lunch with us."::
3928::$$$message_0028_0045_0000$$$::We stand up and leave Sakura's room together.[lr]::
3929::$$$message_0028_0045_0001$$$::It's a typical, unremarkable morning.[lr]::
3930::$$$message_0028_0045_0002$$$::Our warm uneventful days have been passing in peace and quiet.::
903812::$$$message_9028_0006_0002$$$::"Ah... I-I appreciate that."[r]::

